Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 127 "Animal Blood"
    Journal for karus "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Shymer to bring her  Animal Blood."
    Journal for elmorad "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Clark to bring him  Animal Blood."
    Collect 3 of 379273000

Requires player level >= 35

Rewards
    Give 675000 experience

direction_95 = location "Shadow Seeker" about "Shadow Seeker\nMonster which evolved in the war with Pathos by a curse which turned man into wolfman" found "Karus" karus at 909 1279 in zone 1
direction_96 = location "Shadow Seeker" about "Shadow Seeker\nMonster which evolved in the war with Pathos by a curse which turned man into wolfman" found "El Morad" elmorad at 1297 1006 in zone 2

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master! Shaimer is looking for you urgently, Master!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! Clark is looking for you urgently, Master!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Welcome. Nice to meet you. I am Shaimer, and I visit many places around Moradon to do trade. I have something urgent to tell you. [Scroll Merchant] Karon lost some materials she need for making a new scroll, and she has asked me to find some of the them, but I'm having difficulty finding them."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I can find most of them, but I just can't get the  Shadow Seeker's blood or the Blood of Beast. You'd have to hunt Shadow Seekers to get it, but that's easy enough for you, isn't it <selfname>? Heh Heh.\n\nYou need some Shadow Seeker's blood and some Blood of Beasts for Karon to use as Scroll material."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Welcome. Nice to meet you. I'm Clark. I visit many places around Moradon for trading. I have something to urgently tell you. [Scroll Merchant] Karon lost some materials she needed for making a new scroll. She's asked me to find some of the items, but I'm having difficulty."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "I can find most of them, but I just can't get the  Shadow Seeker's blood or the Blood of Beast. You'd have to hunt Shadow Seekers to get it, but that's easy enough for you, isn't it <selfname>? Heh Heh.\n\nYou need some Shadow Seeker's blood and some Blood of Beasts for Karon to use as Scroll material."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Seems I've only <selfname> to trust. Take care out there eh? Heh."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_95
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Seems I've only <selfname> to trust. Take care out there eh? Heh."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_96

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "You have gathered all the Animal Blood Shymer has asked for. Sigh!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You have gathered all the Animal Blood Clark has asked for. Sigh!"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "I knew you could do it, <selfname>. Thanks~ thanks~ and Thank you again. Hee hee!"
